            "sid": "1CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aga nigo maziina g'Abaisraeli, abakuru b'amaju ga baishenkurubo, abakuru b'engabo rukumi-rukumi n'aba igana-igana n'abatware baabo abaabaire nibaheereza omugabe omu murimo gw'okureeberera abantu omu by'okwihaihana kw'embu zaabo, buri rubu rukaba rurimu abantu obukumi bubiri n'enkumi ina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
