              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka Daudi tarabazire batakahikize myaka makumi abiri, ahakuba MUKAMA akagamba ku arikanyisa Abaisraeli, bakaba nk'enyonyoozi z'omu iguru. ",
          "type": "text",
