        },
        {
          "text": " Yoabu mwene Zeruiya yaatandika kubara, kwonka tiyaaheza; nikyo ekiniga kyaiziire ahari Israeli, kandi omubaro ogwo tiguhandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'omugabe Daudi.",
