        },
        {
          "text": "Yonasaani ishento wa Daudi niwe yaabaire ari omuhanuuzi, omushaija orikwetegyereza kandi omuhandiiki; we na Yehieli mwene Hakimooni nibo baabaire nibarera abaana b'omugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
